2-02. Blacksmith aprons shall be worn when;
(a) Working with molten metal;
(b) Forging metal (ie) heated and then beaten to shape or size;
(c) Handling battery acid or caustic.
2-03. Diver's equipment shall be worn whenever work is carried on by hand under water, in water
over shoulder depth.
